OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786906081
OL,3,CHundreds of homes with no water or low
OL,4,Cpressure
OL,6,FHundreds of homes in Kent are facing
OL,7,Fwater problems for a second day, with
OL,8,Fno running water or low pressure.
OL,10,FSouth East Water has apologised to
OL,11,Fcustomers in Charing, Challock and
OL,12,FMolash who are still experiencing
OL,13,Fissues.
OL,15,FThe company said: "We have delivered
OL,16,Fbottled water to customers in the
OL,17,Faffected areas yesterday (Saturday)
OL,18,Fand our teams are delivering to
OL,19,Fimpacted customers again today.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
