OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786906081
OL,3,CHundreds of homes with no water or low
OL,4,Cpressure
OL,6,F"We're sorry to all customers impacted
OL,7,Fby ongoing supply interruptions this
OL,8,Fweekend."
OL,10,FA bottled water station has been set
OL,11,Fup at Challock Village Hall, TN25 4AU.
OL,13,FGrab bags are also available to
OL,14,Fcollect to help with flushing toilets
OL,15,Fbut this is not drinking water.
OL,17,FWater supplies are returning to
OL,18,Fcustomers in the Benenden and
OL,19,FRolvenden areas of Kent after repairs
OL,20,Fwere completed yesterday (Saturday, 15
OL,21,FAugust) following a burst water main.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
