OL,3,CHundreds of homes with no water or low
OL,4,Cpressure
OL,6,FA bottled water station has opened as
OL,7,Fa precaution (Sunday, 16 August) for
OL,8,Fcustomers to collect from.
OL,10,FThis is located at Weald Sports
OL,11,FCentre, Angley Road, Cranbrook, TN17
OL,12,F2PN.
OL,14,FA spokesperson said: "We're sorry to
OL,15,Fall customers impacted by ongoing
OL,16,Fsupply interruptions this weekend.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
