OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786906081
OL,3,CHundreds of homes with no water or low
OL,4,Cpressure
OL,6,F"We know how frustrating it is to be
OL,7,Fwithout water, particularly during
OL,8,Fsuch hot weather, and please be
OL,9,Fassured that our teams are working
OL,10,Ftirelessly to resolve these problems
OL,11,Fas a matter of urgency."
